% home — the home's crossing preds: the person's intents to the cards, through the director (ask_<pkg>). A scene's
% wishes are no longer crossings: the scenes package concludes the home's mode and mood into the world, which every
% package reads as a level (shared/home_world.llp; nina-live's redesign, step 3). Declaration only.
catalog home_iface 1.
provenance text "the home's crossing preds: a scene's wish to the lights, the air and the media" "2026-11-24".
types (scene).

namespace home_iface produce (dyn).

% the person's intent to a card (nina-live's redesign, channel A, s-b478fe59): with the runtime's intent route on,
% a call to a card arrives at the director as one of these; its forward serves the call into the card (the
% runtime keeps the call itself: one at a time). No rule produces or consumes them.
pred ask_lights : home_iface.
pred ask_air : home_iface.
pred ask_media : home_iface.
pred ask_comfort : home_iface.
pred ask_scenes : home_iface.
pred ask_timers : home_iface.
pred ask_agenda : home_iface.
pred ask_music : home_iface.
pred ask_habits : home_iface.
pred ask_glow : home_iface.
pred ask_temperament : home_iface.
pred ask_escalate : home_iface.
